-22T17:54:56-07:00","id":1237849,"title":"","content":"It was nice to hear about Mr. Minton's background and how he was first introduced to the game and later came to be one of its developers. Also, the spoilers at the end as to the contents of the Exigents book were intriguing. Great podcast, overall. Would like to see Mr. Minton do some more podcast appearances, maybe on the newly popular The Deliberative podcast. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> Curious as to whether one of the two types of Exigent 'classes/groups' he confirmed in the book will be the Architects. I thought they were pretty cool and deserved their own write up after their teaser in the Antagonists chapter in the corebook.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3942-hill-crushing-hero","name":"Hill Crushing Hero","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3942_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-22T18:44:01-07:00","id":1237859,"title":"","content":"So excited for Exigents! Are Niobrarans going in there as one of the new sample Exalt types?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Host of <a href=\"http://www.fivepoles.com/podcast/\" target=\"_blank\">The Deliberative Podcast</a><br /> Host of <a href=\"https://tca.edennian.com\" target=\"_blank\">Trinity Continuum Airwaves</a><br /> Original Creator of the complete <a href=\"https://www.fantasygrounds.com/forums/showthread.php?9238-Rules-Lite-New-World-of-Darkness&amp;highlight=\" target=\"_blank\">nWoD conversion of Fantasy Grounds 2</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12730-pneumapilot","name":"PneumaPilot","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12730_4.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"149"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-22T19:37:12-07:00","id":1237865,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>PneumaPilot</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1237806-developer-interview-on-onyx-path-podcast?p=1237859#post1237859\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So excited for Exigents! Are Niobrarans going in there as one of the new sample Exalt types?</div> </div> </div> </div>I think it's the three shown in the corebook: Umbral Exalted, Dream-Souled and Heart-Eaters.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>And stuff.<br /> <sub><a href=\"https://blaqueandstuff.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My DeviantArt Page</a> // <a href=\"http://blaqueandstuff.tumblr.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My tumblr</a> // <a href=\"http://www.dropbox.com/sh/trxegr5hl27s1l5/AAAegBBzxbDhvk1YpYJqdhz8a?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted 3e Houserules</a></sub>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/353-blaque","name":"Blaque","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar353_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2976"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-22T19:39:43-07:00","id":1237866,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>PneumaPilot</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1237806-developer-interview-on-onyx-path-podcast?p=1237859#post1237859\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So excited for Exigents! Are Niobrarans going in there as one of the new sample Exalt types?</div> </div> </div> </div>The Niobrarans were actually the residents of the benthic depths of Creation; their Exalted were called the Spoken and the Chosen of the Depths.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-22T20:39:47-07:00","id":1237875,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Blaque</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1237806-developer-interview-on-onyx-path-podcast?p=1237865#post1237865\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I think it's the three shown in the corebook: Umbral Exalted, Dream-Souled and Heart-Eaters.</div> </div> </div> </div>Where were those shown? In the \u201cother Exalts\u201d picture at the end of the two-page Exalt-type spreads?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Host of <a href=\"http://www.fivepoles.com/podcast/\" target=\"_blank\">The Deliberative Podcast</a><br /> Host of <a href=\"https://tca.edennian.com\" target=\"_blank\">Trinity Continuum Airwaves</a><br /> Original Creator of the complete <a href=\"https://www.fantasygrounds.com/forums/showthread.php?9238-Rules-Lite-New-World-of-Darkness&amp;highlight=\" target=\"_blank\">nWoD conversion of Fantasy Grounds 2</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12730-pneumapilot","name":"PneumaPilot","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12730_4.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"149"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-22T21:13:29-07:00","id":1237880,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>PneumaPilot</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1237806-developer-interview-on-onyx-path-podcast?p=1237875#post1237875\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Where were those shown? In the \u201cother Exalts\u201d picture at the end of the two-page Exalt-type spreads?</div> </div> </div> </div>Yep. The one on the far left is pretty obviously the 1e and 2e Starmetal sig' <i>Lividsom Advid Engineer</i>, while the one on the far right in gold armor and green sunfire is an Inferanl. <br /> <br /> Vance has said the lady with the Aurora anima as a Heart-Eater, the guy being what looks like tormented by the evil cloud is an Umbra Exalt, and the dude in the toga is a Dream-Souled.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>And stuff.<br /> <sub><a href=\"https://blaqueandstuff.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My DeviantArt Page</a> // <a href=\"http://blaqueandstuff.tumblr.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My tumblr</a> // <a href=\"http://www.dropbox.com/sh/trxegr5hl27s1l5/AAAegBBzxbDhvk1YpYJqdhz8a?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted 3e Houserules</a></sub>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/353-blaque","name":"Blaque","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar353_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2976"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-22T21:15:00-07:00","id":1237881,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>PneumaPilot</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1237806-developer-interview-on-onyx-path-podcast?p=1237875#post1237875\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Where were those shown? In the \u201cother Exalts\u201d picture at the end of the two-page Exalt-type spreads?</div> </div> </div> </div>Yes. Vance also spoiled some big info about them, which was collected and discussed in this thread, starting in this post: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1151111-musing-and-theorizing-about-the-new-exalts?p=1184629#post1184629\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/m...29#post1184629</a><br /> <br /> Also, to be specific about which is which: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1151111-musing-and-theorizing-about-the-new-exalts?p=1185408#post1185408\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/m...08#post1185408</a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>....","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/226-brilliantrain","name":"BrilliantRain","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar226_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3718"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-22T23:48:02-07:00","id":1237901,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TheCountAlucard</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1237806-developer-interview-on-onyx-path-podcast?p=1237866#post1237866\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The Niobrarans were actually the residents of the benthic depths of Creation; their Exalted were called the Spoken and the Chosen of the Depths.</div> </div> </div> </div>Initial plans were to have the Chosen of the Depths be their own Exalt type, but as they worked on them they realised they were essentially Exalted pelagothropes (underwater mutants), and decided to go with that; 'Chosen of the Depths' is basically a collective term for Exalted pelagothropes that fought on the Niobraran side, regardless of who Exalted them.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":""